    "answer_zh": "症状：开关门中途/一半走停或反弹（§九；非开到位反弹·非关到位反弹·非§十二限位）\n1 排除红外遇阻影响（未使用红外时可将 DIP 开关 #3 拨 OFF 关闭红外功能）\n2 断电调遇阻力与缓停止（FORCE 电位器略顺时针增大遇阻力；SOFT STOP 电位器略逆时针减小缓停时间）\n3 还有问题的话，可以控制板上一次只接一个机臂，找出问题机臂，然后做下面的测试\n4 打开离合，用离合钥匙打开离合，在距门铰链约1米（3.3英尺）处手动开合门，检查是否推拉顺畅；不顺请告知门宽门重，并复核门能否用手顺畅运行\n5 机臂从门上拿下来试试按遥控器的时候机臂能否正常伸缩\n6 还不行发视频\n如果上面步骤还不行，可以考虑测电压，和转拉耳180°的排查\n如果机臂不带门也伸出一点就反弹，其他已排除，客人不能测电机电流：\n可以让客户把离合打开，按遥控器看看电机有没有问题，如果没问题，那么也很有可能机臂存在某个卡点。如果离合打开电机还有问题，可以做测电机，如果此时电机可以正常运行，那控制板可能有故障了。",
    "answer_en": "1 If the photocell is used, please ensure the photocell sensor beam is not blocked. Clear any objects blocking the photocell sensor. Check if the photocell sensor is defective and properly installed. If the photocell is not used, please set the switch #3 to OFF to disable the photocell sensor function.\n2 Turn off the power to the gate opener (disconnect the power source from the +BAT- terminals), then locate FORCE Potentiometer on the control board and turn it slightly clockwise to increase the stall force. Then locate SOFT STOP Potentiometer and turn it slightly counterclockwise to decrease the soft stop time. After adjusting, turn on the power to the gate opener and press the remote control to open and close the gate through a full cycle. Press the remote again to see it the gate opener works better.\n3 If the problem persists, connect only one arm to the control board at a time to identify the faulty one. Once identified, proceed with the tests below. If neither arm works properly, check each arm individually using the following tests.\n4 Use the release key to disengage the clutch of the arm, and check whether the gate can be manually opened & closed freely 3.3 feet (one meter) away from the gate hinge. If not, please let me know the weight and length of your gate and double check the gate to make sure the gate can run freely by hand.\n5 Please take down the arm from the gate, engage the clutch, hold its front mount, and then press the remote to see if the arm can extend and retract properly each time. If the arm can run normally in this case, the arm is fine. The problem might be from the cooperation between the gate opener and the gate.\n6 Please shoot some videos showing the performance of the arms when you do the test for further judgement. You can directly send the video to my E-mail via the attachment. If the sending is not successful, please share the photo or video link through dropbox, icloud or google drive. Thanks for your understanding and cooperation.\n1 Please detect the voltage of the +BAT- (11#, 12#) terminals on the control board after pressing the remote to see whether the voltage can stay at almost 24V (above 22V). If the voltage is fine, please do the following tests.  （一般情况走停需要监测电压是否压降，反弹不需要）\n2 If the arm and gate are fine, please rotate the front mount 180 degrees to try again.\n1 Use the release key to disengage the clutch.\n2 Press the remote button to check if the motor runs continuously in one direction. You may need to listen to the motor sound to confirm. Press the remote again to stop the motor, then press one more time to test if it runs normally in the opposite direction.\nIf the motor runs normally in both directions, please manually extend and retract the arm (with the clutch still disengaged) to check for any difficulty in movement.\nIf the motor cannot run continuously, you can check the motor. Keep the clutch released, connect the red & black wires of the arm to the DC 24V power source directly, the motor should run, and then exchange the polarity of the wires, the motor should run in the opposite direction. If the motor runs normally in both directions, the motor itself is good and the control board is likely faulty.",
