    "heading_level": 2,
    "answer_zh": "推荐电池：\n适配器插到BAT端口的话，POWER灯正常闪烁，FULL灯会常亮提示过压。输入电源插到适配器端口，CODE灯会微弱的常亮。只接适配器在adapter端口也是CODE灯微弱的亮\nAD5S如果12AH的电池不充电（机器不接任何配件，每天用10-15个循环）可以用7-8天，7AH电池可以用4-5天。\n太阳能板是随着光照强度不一样，充电电压是变化的，原则上开路电压（就是太阳能板不接控制器的时候两端的电压）不超过45V\n正常光照下，太阳能板和UPS01或TCS3，以及电池（电池本身可被正常充电）正常接线的情况下，测太阳能板的输出 （SOL端口），测出来的数值就是跟着电池电压走的，比如电池此时是26V，那测太阳能板的输出的时候，结果应该也是26V的样子\nTCS3太阳能控制器和UPS01一样，如果电池电压低于18V，那么控制器也可能不正常工作，导致充电有问题。电池小于18V，红灯快闪；大概到了多少16 17V时，三个灯都不亮。\nTCS3，电池电压低于22V/21V，过放灯会亮，切断了控制器输出，但是还是能继续控制太阳能板给电池充电的,只是充的很慢。\nTCS3，即使是LOAD没连到控制板，只是太阳能组套来给电池充电的情况下，电池电压高于18V，控制器在这个时候正常也是可以控制太阳能板给电池充电的。但是就怕电池有问题导致充不上，这种情况可以让他太阳能板直接接电池充电试试看\n30W太阳能板对应最大20Ah的电池  60W太阳能板对应最大35Ah的电池\n外接收器和有线面板接的电源端口一般都是长期有电的\n用作保护的红外接节能型的平开门机，接线如说明书中那样接，待机是不耗电的，所以带S的机器可不用加大太阳能板功率和电池容量，如果用作开门，红外电源就要接到BAT端口，这个时候纯太阳能供电的机器需要考虑电池容量和太阳能板功率。\n接耗电有线配件需要扩大太阳能板功率和电池容量\n带太阳能组套的开门机的使用频次问题\n别的牌子的太阳能板和控制器用于我们的开门机\n待机电流小于10mA，然后确保是太阳能板和控制器额定电压都是24VDC\n太阳能板串联的时候电压增加，并联的时候电压不变，电流变大。不管串联还是并联太阳能板的功率都会增加。电池是串联的时候电压增加，容量不变，并联的时候电压不变，容量增加。\n其他知识\n解释AB值\n解释XY值\n如果客人问为什么表格中没列出 “A” 小于13cm的值，以及“B”大于27cm的值，可以这么回答。\n机臂进水：\n可以让客人晾干水汽试试，如果里面锈蚀了，可以用WD40或者其他除锈剂清理干净看看， 如果还不行，得换机臂了\n检查离合孔盖有没有破损等",
    "answer_en": "The batteries for the gate opener are NOT available at our store. You may order the batteries from other stores. Generally, a 24V 12Ah battery (or 2pcs 12V 12Ah batteries connected in series may function as 24V) is required to power the gate opener. Lead acid / GEL / AGM / flooded (deep cycle) batteries can be used. Kindly note that the regulator is not compatible with most lithium-ion batteries, except for LiFePO4 batteries. And the battery should be waterproof type, or be placed in waterproof circumstance.\nMoreover, if you only use solar panels to charge the batteries (no AC electricity), you’re required to increase the solar panels power and the batteries capacity in the following situations:\n1. Add continuously electricity-consuming accessories such as exit sensor wand, wired keypad, external receiver, etc. Normally, if you add such an accessory, you need to add 30W more solar panels.\n2. There is less than 6 hours sunlight or the gate opener should be operated more than 10 cycles per day.\nThe capacity of the batteries and the power of the solar panel should be enlarged if you want to use some accessories that consume power in standby mode.\nThe connection of TEW3 Car Exit Wand will speed up battery drain. If batteries are chosen to be the main power source and to be charged only by solar panel in this case, the power of the solar panel should be up to 60W, and the battery needs to be 17Ah.\nIt depends on the frequency of use and sunshine duration. Generally speaking, if you use 7.2Ah batteries, the average sunshine duration is more than 6 hours daily, and there aren't power-consuming accessories connected to the gate opener, the gate opener can run less than 10 open & close cycles per day. The kit comes with an adapter which can be plugged into AC outlet to charge the batteries. If there isn't much sunlight and the gate opener is used frequently daily, it is suggested to use batteries of higher capacity (like 12Ah or 17Ah) and the adapter to power the system together with solar.\nThe \"A\" value is the horizontal distance from the gate hinge to the joint of the arm and the pivot bracket; while the \"B\" is vertical distance from the gate hinge to that joint.\nThe \"X\" value stands for the distance from gate hinge to the mounting surface of post brackets, while the \"Y\" value refers to the width of the mounting surface of post brackets.\nIf \"A\" is less than 13cm, the arm will hit the gate; while if \"B\" is greater than 27cm, it is beyond the maximum distance that the arm can extend.\nAs for the problem that water went into the arm, please check whether the clutch port of the arm is properly covered and whether there is any damage in the sealing ring of the outer cover. Otherwise, water will penetrate into the arm.",
